2. **COOP/COEP Headers**: COOP (`same-origin`) and COEP (`require-corp`) headers are configured in `next.config.ts`. Any third-party cross-origin asset (e.g. ad banners) must support CORP or CORS to avoid cross-origin isolation blocking in production environments.

