### Tier 2: Boundary & Corner Cases (31 Tests)

#### 1. `video-trim`
- [x] **T2.1.1**: 0-byte empty file input is rejected before processing.
- [x] **T2.1.2**: Corrupted container lacking `moov` box is detected and isolated.
